---
layout: base.njk
title: Journal — Abantika
description: Field notes, research logs, and progress notes by Abantika.
image: /assets/og-image.png
---
{% set notes = journal | published %}
<div class="page-shell">
{% include "components/header.njk" %}
<main class="inner-page journal-page">
  <section class="page-intro compact"><p class="eyebrow">04 / JOURNAL</p><h1>WHAT I DID<br>TODAY<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1><p>A research log and field notebook for analytical work. Each published note has a dated route.</p></section>
  {% if notes.length %}
  <section class="journal-index" aria-label="Journal entries">
    {% for note in notes %}
    <a class="journal-index-row" href="{{ note.url }}">
      <div class="journal-index-date"><strong>{{ note.day }}</strong><span>{{ note.monthShort }} {{ note.year }}</span></div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{% if note.project %}PROJECT / {{ note.project | replace("-", " ") | upper }}{% else %}FIELD NOTE{% endif %}</p>
        <h2>{{ note.headline | joinLines | safe }}<span class="red-stop">.</span></h2>
        <p>{{ note.summary }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% else %}
  <section class="journal-empty"><div><span>DD</span><span>MM</span><span>YY</span></div><article><p class="eyebrow">FIRST ENTRY / PENDING</p><h2>THE WORKING<br>NOTEBOOK<span class="red-stop">.</span></h2><p>[PLACEHOLDER — Published research notes, what was learned, and next steps will appear here.]</p></article><aside>DATA<br>METHOD<br>RESULT<br>NEXT</aside></section>
  {% endif %}
</main>
{% include "components/footer.njk" %}
</div>
